# SimpleTier1 with secondary products retiring to every kind of disposal
# pool: landfill split into degradable and non-degradable parts (1000, 1004),
# dumps (1001, 1003) and fuel (1005), with PaperPackaging also recycling into
# itself. Degradable landfill paper (1010) has a half-life of 0.5 years, so it
# is used up years before the end while the non-degradable part remains.
# Harvest runs to year 10 and YearsPostHarvest is 10, so every pool is
# reported through year 20, and nothing after it.
exit_zero: yes
log_lacks: Mismatch in pool allocations
product_balance: yes
reports_through: 20
